like how it would play out,

00:23:53.310 --> 00:23:55.147
like who I would vote
for and all that stuff.

00:23:55.147 --> 00:23:57.370
And I couldn't really place AJ.

00:23:57.370 --> 00:23:58.420
It makes things easier,

00:23:58.420 --> 00:23:59.720
but it also makes things harder now

00:23:59.720 --> 00:24:02.290
because now I just don't know.

00:24:02.290 --> 00:24:04.898
So today I kinda stepped it up.

00:24:04.898 --> 00:24:07.648
(screen beeping)

00:24:10.175 --> 00:24:11.087
- All right y'all.

00:24:11.087 --> 00:24:11.920
- Good night, everyone.

00:24:11.920 --> 00:24:12.844
- Good night.

00:24:12.844 --> 00:24:13.927
- Good night.

00:24:16.411 --> 00:24:19.078
(siren ringing)

00:24:20.836 --> 00:24:23.854
- I can't wait to get my day started.

00:24:23.854 --> 00:24:26.020
I'm ready to play.

00:24:26.020 --> 00:24:27.770
I'm focused now.

00:24:27.770 --> 00:24:28.973
I have a strategy now.

00:24:30.470 --> 00:24:32.853
Next elimination might gotta make a move.

00:24:35.663 --> 00:24:36.801
I gotta win.

00:24:36.801 --> 00:24:39.347
(suspenseful music)

00:24:39.347 --> 00:24:41.630
- [Narrator] Next time on "Money Game."

00:24:41.630 --> 00:24:42.600
- Sam and Shannon,

00:24:42.600 --> 00:24:44.560
being able to pass those
all throughout the night

00:24:44.560 --> 00:24:46.020
it's starting to worry me.

00:24:46.020 --> 00:24:48.440
- I feel like there is an opportunity

00:24:48.440 --> 00:24:49.810
for me to be voted out.

00:24:49.810 --> 00:24:51.630
- Anybody's the most deserving is us.

00:24:51.630 --> 00:24:52.463
You know what I'm saying?

00:24:52.463 --> 00:24:54.730
- This is becoming super
an emotional thing.

00:24:54.730 --> 00:24:56.730
- Here almost feels like more comfortable

00:24:56.730 --> 00:24:58.603
than like being at home.

00:24:58.603 --> 00:25:01.210
(beep)

00:25:01.210 --> 00:25:02.043
- Is she playing games with all this.

00:25:02.043 --> 00:25:04.210
- Either she's playing
games or she's convinced

00:25:04.210 --> 00:25:05.610
and either way I'm not safe.

